WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.380
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.810
H-How could you?!

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:26.270
You can see for yourself
how terrifying curses are.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.740
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.100
Where are we going?

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:10.650
To see Taitanbo-sama.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.900
Taitanbo-sama?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.110
He's a guardian god who lives on
the forbidden mountain.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.740
Do gods really exist?

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:24.120
This town has been protected by
that god since long ago.

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:27.040
Or so many people believe.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.370
Yoichiro.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.830
I'm sorry, Father.

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:37.050
Our Agata family has guarded
this forbidden mountain for generations.

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:43.050
When you turn 20, you'll take on
that role from your father, Kento.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.290
That is your destiny.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:54.670
We're here.
That's Taitanbo-sama's Spirit Stone.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:59.570
Listen, Kento, a guardian has two jobs.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:04.240
Offer prayer to the Spirit Stone
every four days without fail.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:05.330
And...

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:12.650
never let anyone not born and raised in
this town approach here.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:19.340
If these edicts are ever broken,
a terrible curse shall befall you.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.660
A curse?

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.370
CHAPTER 70

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:28.350
SPIRIT AFFLICTION
MYSTERIOUS FOOTPRINTS

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.360
Let's go.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:43.530
Kento, we shouldn't...

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.430
My 20th birthday is in a week.

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:49.000
I'm settling this before that.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.020
What are you doing there?!

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.000
Dad.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.130
Don't tell me...
you mean to harm the Spirit Stone?!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.800
I won't be the mountain's guardian.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.260
I'm leaving this town!

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:02.260
You'd break the edict?!

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.180
I'm sick of it!

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.080
Harm that stone and
terrible things will happen.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.140
A terrible curse will befall you.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.980
Who are you?

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:16.940
I don't believe in any curses.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.720
Those two said the same thing as you.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.380
And as a result...

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:28.410
What's wrong?

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:33.250
N-Nothing.
That stupid kid just ticked me off.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.350
Let's go.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.090
Thank you very much, Kitaro-san.

00:04:42.530 --> 00:04:46.530
Your son's changed a lot.

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:49.560
Kento-san.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.810
Do you have to destroy the Spirit Stone
of the forbidden mountain?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:54.860
Yeah.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:59.230
Are you sure?
If there really is a curse...

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.960
Shut up, Takashi!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.320
There's no curse...

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.610
Grandpa?

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.930
Yes. He's dead.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:13.170
You broke the guardian's edict!
That's why the town was cursed!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.730
It's all your fault!

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:20.300
We're going back to the mountain.

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.800
Huh? Now?!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.890
Kento, we shouldn't. I'm scared.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:28.890
I've been bound ever since I was a kid.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:32.280
By the edict of the mountain...
By my family's destiny...

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:33.770
And by my dad...

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.610
With that stone gone, I can be free.

00:05:37.610 --> 00:05:38.480
But...

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.270
Chinatsu, stay here with Takashi.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.280
Me and Wataru will do it.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:44.530
Huh?!

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.960
That's careless of Dad.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.960
Who cares?
Saves us from having to break in.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.480
I guess so.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.010
Kento, I checked the web.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:18.890
Apparently, two strangers who came here
long ago are still missing.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.150
Could it be that...

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.700
Wataru, you're talking about
curses now, too?!

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:29.910
Calm down. I was joking.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:37.960
Okay, let's break it.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:38.960
Okay.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.630
Harm this stone
and terrible things will happen.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.170
I warned you.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.840
You again?

00:06:46.190 --> 00:06:48.590
Your father told me.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:55.230
I understand your resentment against
the edict and your destiny.

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:56.190
But...

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:59.230
Shut up! What do you know?!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.870
The curse is real.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.030
I'll tell you everything.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.030
Thirteen years ago...

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:09.780
<i>The day after you first came here.</i>

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:15.160
<i>You suddenly fell deathly ill
and were given a few months to live.</i>

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:19.120
<i>What's more, the medicine
was extremely expensive.</i>

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.840
Could it be Taitanbo-sama's...

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.130
You're saying it's his curse?

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.110
<i>That's when those men arrived.</i>

00:07:28.900 --> 00:07:32.550
You're from the Agata family?
The mountain's guardians?

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.430
Yes.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.600
We have an offer for you.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:42.360
You see, our fathers are the presidents of
famous super elite corporations.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:46.240
As a result, since we were children
we've gotten anything we wanted

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:49.110
and led quite boring lives.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.780
Basically, we seek stimulation.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.160
So, why come to me?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.490
We'd like to see your Spirit Stone.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:08:03.540
Impossible! If an outsider enters
the mountain, a terrible curse will...

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.550
A curse! That sounds exciting!

00:08:06.550 --> 00:08:10.720
That's precisely the sort of stimulation
we're seeking!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.260
I refuse! Please leave!

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:16.510
How's a ten-million-yen recompense sound?

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:21.190
We just want a photo.
It's not a bad deal, is it?

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:22.960
We'll be back tomorrow.

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:28.990
<i>Your father, after much deliberation,</i>

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:34.780
<i>decided to accept their offer
without telling your grandfather.</i>

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.910
<i>But the next day...</i>

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.280
Don't tell me...!

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:45.290
Are you satisfied?
It's about time you should lea--

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:49.720
Hold on a minute.
We wired a whole ten million to the bank.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:53.760
We deserve a little souvenir
to make it worthwhile.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.180
N-No!

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:56.140
Now, now.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.820
Don't!

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.000
H-How could you?!

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.140
Father!

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:05.900
Why?!

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:08.150
It's paternal love.

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:13.490
He broke the mountain's edict himself
so you wouldn't be cursed.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.910
How touching.
Not like curses are real, though.

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:32.300
I-It's a curse!

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:35.150
Taitanbo-sama's been angered!

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:41.430
<i>I received a letter from your grandfather.</i>

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:47.150
<i>And I was asked to get
the stolen Spirit Stone fragment back.</i>

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:48.440
<i>And...</i>

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:52.710
Please protect my son and grandson.

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.920
I beg of y...

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:58.320
Father! Father!

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:04.330
He took on the curse himself.

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.850
But it's not over yet.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:13.550
Ooh, that forbidden mountain has
several legends of buried gold.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:17.110
Why hasn't anyone discovered...

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:21.680
That's it! The rumors of a curse
act as camouflage to hide it!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.060
I better tell Nakamura about...

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.250
Huh?

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:28.580
I-It's gone.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.270
It's gone!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.770
It's gone, it's gone, it's gone!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:40.030
This stone is composed of some
as-of-yet undiscovered element!

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.080
That means...
the Spirit Stone is a meteorite!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.040
Nakamura! W-We have a problem!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:49.250
Ah, Yamada.
I've just made a huge discovery!

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:53.360
Forget about that! My pinky is gone!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.300
Could it be...?

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.880
N-Now it's my ear!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.560
A-Amazing!

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:02.760
Wh-What is?!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.910
It could be caused by space bacteria!

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.270
My eye! My eye!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.420
I'm right!
It's the discovery of the century!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:18.910
You're wrong. That's the curse from
Taitanbo of the forbidden mountain.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:21.160
Wh-Who are you?

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:23.910
I'm GeGeGe no Kitaro.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.910
I'm here for
the Spirit Stone fragment you stole.

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.380
Kid, what are you talking about?

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:34.920
H-Hold on! Did you just mention a curse?

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:35.790
Yes.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:40.800
If you don't hurry and return it
things will get even worse.

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:45.600
H-He's right! I-It's a curse!

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:49.520
Nakamura! Give the fragment to this kid!

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:53.060
What are you talking about?
There's no curse!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.900
B-But... my face...

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:59.110
Your face? You've got tons of money!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:01.900
You can fix that
with some plastic surgery!

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:03.970
You're right...

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.760
M-My face!

00:12:12.310 --> 00:12:14.630
WATCH OUT, KITARO!

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:19.130
THIS IS BAD!

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.030
-<i>"Eek!"</i>
-<i>"What?"</i>

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.030
<i>"Scratch, scratch."</i>

00:12:21.110 --> 00:12:22.860
Footprints...

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:26.640
Wh-What is this?

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:29.140
Don't you get it?

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:33.520
Your friend was erased by the curse.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:40.170
Please return the Spirit Stone fragment.
Otherwise you too will...

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:41.780
Ridiculous!

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:44.030
Curses are unscientific!

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.660
I'll solve all these mysteries!

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:50.160
Kitaro, there's no point
in talking any further.

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:56.460
Taitanbo's curse takes not only the body,
but the heart as well.

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:58.460
Very well. In that case...

00:12:58.460 --> 00:12:59.960
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:07.450
If this stops the curse,
consider yourself lucky.

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.520
Hey! Wait!

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:15.020
How is this lucky?!

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:25.320
Taitanbo's anger should subside now.

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:27.030
Thank you very much.

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:30.120
No. It's too soon to relax.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.540
What do you mean?

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.370
Look at the sky.
The dark clouds haven't disappeared.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:39.190
Why not? We returned the fragment.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.590
How dare you get in my way!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.260
Y-You!

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.260
Know what this is?

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:49.760
I'll blow you to pieces
along with that stone...

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.760
and take the fragments home!

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:54.330
Then my fame will...

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.650
Wh-What is this?!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:00.150
It's Taitanbo-sama's curse!

00:14:01.040 --> 00:14:04.650
I-I can't see! Help me!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.090
Help!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.460
After that,
the cloud covering the town disappeared,

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.420
and, Kento-san, your illness went away.

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:28.510
With everyone who broke the edict gone,
Taitanbo's anger finally abated.

00:14:28.510 --> 00:14:30.430
The curse ended.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:34.430
Lies! It's all made up!
I won't believe it!

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.680
Curses aren't real!

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:41.860
I guess trying to
convince you was a waste.

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.690
Very well.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:48.380
You can see for yourself
how terrifying curses are.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.530
Sure. Bring it on.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:57.660
I'm going to be free. Curse me if you can!

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.330
Hey, give me that, Wataru!

00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:07.840
I did it!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.430
There was one more thing to tell you.

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:14.310
Shut up! Curses aren't real.

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:17.220
I'm finally free.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:27.110
Welcome back, Kento-san.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.450
Where's Chinatsu?

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:31.240
She was waiting but she just went home.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:32.410
Oh.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.910
Takashi, could you
carve this into a pendant?

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:37.370
It's for Chinatsu.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:40.460
That stone... Is it...?!

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:44.060
What are you scared of? It's just a stone.

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.300
It's a pretty stone.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:50.300
Got it. It'll be done by tomorrow.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.220
There's no rush.

00:15:52.570 --> 00:15:55.740
It's okay. I'll work all night.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.160
Okay then.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.190
Here's a present.

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:08.300
To celebrate my freedom
I had Takashi make it.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.440
Wait, is this...

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:14.410
-I figured you'd be scared.
-Well, it's scary.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.890
It's not scary. It's just a stone.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:21.160
It's so pretty.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.250
Could you put it on me?

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.350
Sure.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.630
Sorry. It's from Takashi.

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:28.500
Hello?

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.890
<i>Kento-san, I think the curse is real.</i>

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:33.050
What?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.010
<i>When I woke up this morning...</i>

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.510
<i>my pinky was gone!</i>

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:40.520
Your pinky's gone? Stop joking around.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.270
<i>I'm not joking...!</i>

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.610
<i>My ear's gone now! And my nose!</i>

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:50.280
<i>H-Help me! Kento-sa...</i>

00:16:50.280 --> 00:16:52.070
Hey! Hello?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:53.240
What's wrong?

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.350
Takashi's acting funny.
I'll go check on him!

00:16:57.260 --> 00:16:59.430
Takashi? You in?

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.810
Footprints?

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.780
What is this?!

00:17:11.940 --> 00:17:13.970
Hello? Wataru?

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:17.760
We're going back to the mountain
to destroy that stone completely!

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:19.470
Huh? What do you mean?

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.540
Just hurry and...

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:23.650
What?

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.080
H-Huh?

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.940
Wh-What is this?!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.260
Because I broke the stone...

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:37.070
Chinatsu!

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:38.890
Chinatsu!

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:43.210
What's wrong, Kento? You're all pale.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:46.140
Wataru's dead. Takashi, too, I think.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.770
But it's not any curse!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:50.170
Curses aren't...

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:54.050
You know, I was thinking of
returning this stone.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:54.970
Huh?

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:59.220
It's just, it gives me a rash that itches.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:02.980
It itches.
It itches, it itches, it itches!

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.520
Kento! Help...

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:15.300
This is...

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:19.490
Damn you! Why isn't it me?!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:22.890
Why Chinatsu and my friends?!

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:31.900
<i>Use this.</i>

00:18:35.320 --> 00:18:37.320
Dynamite?

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.840
Okay. I'm sure I can destroy it with this!

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:42.930
I'll do it!

00:18:42.930 --> 00:18:43.850
Take this!

00:18:54.050 --> 00:18:56.190
I did it! How about that?!

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:59.200
I blew a god to smithereens!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:27.930
Let go!

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:30.750
Let go! Let go!

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:39.780
Th-That was...

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.030
What in the world is going on?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:46.290
We showed you what would happen
if you shattered the Spirit Stone.

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:52.290
We burned Sand Witch's special
Hallucination Sand in a Yokai Censer.

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:55.340
Everything you saw was an illusion.

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.880
Then... it wasn't real?

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:01.800
Right. But something similar would happen.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.640
That's certain.

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.160
Kento!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.900
Why'd you come?!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:13.570
Because I was worried of course!

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:14.810
Me too!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.990
Chinatsu... Takashi...

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:18.550
What now?

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:22.820
Do you still want to
harm this Spirit Stone?

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.260
We're leaving.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:30.020
I said I have one more thing to tell you.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:34.730
Thirteen years ago,
when he first brought you here,

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.420
your father had an idea.

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:44.200
He wanted to end the role of guardian with
him and let you live your life freely.

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:48.640
But the next day, you fell ill.

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:52.410
Your father blamed himself for it.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:58.150
He thought Taitanbo must have realized
he meant to break the edict.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:03.150
That's why he was so strict
in making you take on the role.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:07.160
It was to keep you from
ever falling into harm again.

00:21:08.010 --> 00:21:11.160
It was all to protect me?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.210
It wasn't just him.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:17.860
Your grandfather was
truly concerned for you.

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:20.900
Enough to die for you.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:30.740
You turn 20 today.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.160
Yes.

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:34.500
Let's go then.

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:56.540
<i>It hurts, it hurts...</i>

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:59.360
<i>Such pain, such pain...</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:06.110
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>Ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:09.120
<i>ga gi gu ge Go Go Go</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>Ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:15.000
<i>ga ga gi gu GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>Clop-clop-clop on a moonlit night</i>

00:22:17.420 --> 00:22:21.300
<i>kankara kororin tsukiyo no ban ni</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>They gather to the clopping of geta</i>

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.380
<i>geta wo narashite yatsura ga atsumarya</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>Daddy Eyeball in his bath bowl</i>

00:22:25.510 --> 00:22:29.340
<i>medama no oyaji chawan no furo de</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>A single lecture and everyone consents</i>

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:32.760
<i>sekkyou ippatsu nattoku</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>We teach the rampant ones a lesson</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:40.690
<i>yaritai houdai no minasama niwa
okyu mo suemasu</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>We can't just do nothing</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:45.280
<i>hottokenai desyo</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>To the mysterious GeGeGe Forest</i>

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:51.120
<i>fushigi na GeGeGe no Mori e</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>Take a deep breath together</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.910
<i>issyo ni shinkokyu</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>So we can live happily</i>

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>waratte kuraseru youni</i>

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:04.510
<i>My </i>chanchanko<i> is... missing?!</i>

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:07.800
<i>Dad, could it have been him?</i>

00:23:07.930 --> 00:23:10.140
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:12.390
<i>"Karakasa's Umbrella Troubles"</i>

00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:15.100
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
